          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "LLM01_PROMPT_INJECTION",
              "name": "LLM Prompt Injection Risk",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "LLM Prompt Injection Risk"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "User-controlled or retrieved content may override, bypass, or manipulate model instructions."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "CWE: CWE-20\n\nOWASP: LLM01:2025 - Prompt Injection\n\nRemediation:\n- Treat user-supplied and retrieved content as untrusted data and keep it structurally separate from system/developer instructions.\n- Do not let model-generated text directly authorize privileged tool calls; enforce server-side authorization and least privilege for every tool action.\n- Validate model outputs before executing commands, sending requests, changing records, or exposing sensitive context.\n- Add adversarial regression tests for instruction override, indirect prompt injection, data exfiltration, and unauthorized tool use.",
                "markdown": "CWE: CWE-20\n\nOWASP: LLM01:2025 - Prompt Injection\n\nRemediation:\n- Treat user-supplied and retrieved content as untrusted data and keep it structurally separate from system/developer instructions.\n- Do not let model-generated text directly authorize privileged tool calls; enforce server-side authorization and least privilege for every tool action.\n- Validate model outputs before executing commands, sending requests, changing records, or exposing sensitive context.\n- Add adversarial regression tests for instruction override, indirect prompt injection, data exfiltration, and unauthorized tool use."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note",
                "rank": 20.0
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "HIGH",
                "problem.severity": "Low",
                "security-severity": "2.0",
